---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import {site} from '../data/site';
import {validEndpoint} from '../lib/enquiry';
const online=validEndpoint(site.enquiryEndpoint);
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy | Ashbi Design" description="How Ashbi handles project enquiries and appointment bookings." noindex={true}>
<main id="main">
<section class="interior-hero container"><span class="eyebrow">PRIVACY</span><h1>Your privacy <em>matters.</em></h1><p>How we use the information you share when you enquire about a project or book a conversation with Ashbi.</p></section>
<section class="section container article-body">
<h2>Project enquiries</h2><p>We use your name, email address, selected service and project description to respond to your enquiry. Company, website and timing are optional. When you arrive from a case study or campaign page, we include that page as context for your request. Please leave passwords, payment details and other sensitive information out of your brief.</p>
{online?<p>When you submit a brief online, it is stored encrypted on our server and sent to our studio mailbox using Mailgun. We use this information to review your request and discuss the work with you.</p>:<p>The email option prepares a draft in your email application. It does not send automatically. Until you send that email, the draft remains in your browser or email application. Your email provider and ours process messages that you choose to send.</p>}
<h2>Booking a call</h2><p>Our booking link opens Google Calendar. Information you provide there is used to arrange your appointment with Bianca. Google’s privacy terms apply to its booking service.</p>
<h2>Website activity</h2><p>The site does not currently send interaction analytics to an external analytics provider. Local interaction events do not include the contents of your brief. The hosting service may process technical request information, such as IP addresses, to serve and protect the website.</p>
<h2>Your information</h2><p>Contact us to ask about the information you have shared, request a correction or request deletion. We will discuss any information that needs to be retained in connection with an active project.</p>
<h2>Contact</h2><p>Email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> with privacy questions.</p>
</section></main></BaseLayout>
